00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:58.400
just like anybody else. I think, you know, you&nbsp;
can look at what Merrick Garland is going to do.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:03.600
I think my primary, my first analysis&nbsp;
would be what's going to happen to him&nbsp;&nbsp;

