to me. I've always said the same thing about that.&nbsp;
Why don't they just go after that one moment. It's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:23.760
on tape. You have the smoking gun, he's saying. I&nbsp;
mean, I remember when Rod Blagojevich was on tape,&nbsp;&nbsp;

